---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="modest" class="py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#0B132B] relative border-t border-[#CBAC70]/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 space-y-8 sm:space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="04 / Dedicated Capsule"
      title="Malega Modest"
      subtitle="Busana modest dan koko kontemporer dengan potongan rapi, material bernapas, dan keanggunan minimalis."
      align="split"
      linkText="Explore Modest Line"
      linkHref="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Malega%20Apparel%20saya%20tertarik%20dengan%20koleksi%20Malega%20Modest."
    />

    <!-- 2-Column Split Editorial Card -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Modest Showcase Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-sm overflow-hidden bg-[#0E1736] border border-[#CBAC70]/25 group">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=85"
            alt="Malega Modest Collection - Contemporary Koko & Tunics"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
            width="800"
            height="1000"
          />

          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0B132B] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-70 pointer-events-none" />

          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 sm:right-6 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-[#CBAC70]">
              CONTEMPORARY MANDARIN
            </span>
            <span class="text-[#FDFCFF] font-medium text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              Linen & Poplin
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Modest Narrative & Feature Breakdown -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 sm:space-y-8">
        
        <div class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#CBAC70] uppercase tracking-[0.25em]">
            MODEST FORM REFINED
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-[#FDFCFF] leading-tight">
            Elegance Designed for Moments That Matter.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-base text-[#8E9BAE] leading-relaxed font-normal pt-0.5 sm:pt-1">
            Lini Malega Modest memadukan nilai kesantunan dengan estetika modern. Menghadirkan kemeja koko kerah mandarin, kurta minimalis, dan busana modest serbaguna yang nyaman dikenakan untuk ibadah harian maupun momen bermakna.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Feature Points -->
        <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 pt-1 sm:pt-2">
          
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-sm bg-[#0E1736]/60 border border-[#CBAC70]/15 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#FDFCFF]">
                Clean Band & Mandarin Collars
              </h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-[#CBAC70]">01</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#8E9BAE] leading-relaxed">
              Konstruksi kerah shanghai/mandarin yang kokoh, rapi, dan tidak menekan leher untuk kenyamanan maksimal.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-sm bg-[#0E1736]/60 border border-[#CBAC70]/15 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#FDFCFF]">
                Breathable Premium Blends
              </h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-[#CBAC70]">02</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#8E9BAE] leading-relaxed">
              Kain katun poplin dan tenun linen premium yang sejuk, menyerap keringat, dan memiliki jatuhan anggun.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-sm bg-[#0E1736]/60 border border-[#CBAC70]/15 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#FDFCFF]">
                Understated Modern Detailing
              </h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-[#CBAC70]">03</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#8E9BAE] leading-relaxed">
              Aksen kancing tersembunyi, jahitan presisi, dan kantong fungsional tanpa ornamen yang berlebihan.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
